-- dispatch (project): the constrained callee, in another module. Its
-- `where` clause names a variable that occurs ONLY in the result — the
-- shape no cross-module evidence fixture had, because every other one
-- (`ImportedMethod`, `LiteralEvidenceAcrossModules`, `ExtWithParts`) puts
-- the constrained variable in an argument, where the call site's own
-- arguments pin it.
--
-- Its own table is the control: one evidence parameter, one site, and the
-- site is `evidence 0` because the constraint's root is the declaration's
-- rigid (§6.7, §8.4).
import String


pub decodeInto : String -> a
    where a.fromList : List Char -> a
decodeInto s =
    a.fromList (String.toList s)
